abstract: >
  Python implementation of the wbsim simulation model for evaluating the
  performance of residential solar-optimised EV charging stations
  (wallboxes). This is a validated port of the original MATLAB model
  (wbsim_7_81.m) developed as part of the Wallbox-Inspektion research
  project.
